# The autosave delay prompt refuses 50 ms with the reason and accepts 250 ms.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
END
keys g, <Tab> j <Tab> <Enter>
see Autosave delay: 1000
keys <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS>
type 50
keys <Enter>
see Autosave delay must be a whole number, at least 100
keys <BS> <BS>
type 250
keys <Enter>
see 250 ms
